  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AfCFTA Export Training Programme for African SMEs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The partnership between Afreximbank and ITC, signed in 2020, has led to the development of a practical, vocational, and non-accredited export training program called &quot;How to Export with the AfCFTA&quot;. This hybrid program has achieved remarkable success, with almost 11,000 participants from 52 African countries accessing the online component, and 1,228 participants from 15 selected African countries benefiting from the offline component. The offline component was implemented in partnership with local institutions, which ITC trained to market the training and conduct sessions on a continuous basis. Across the 15 implementing countries, 218 trainers have been trained, allowing for the localisation of the program to suit each national context. The training program has also continued to be implemented in additional countries under the new agreement with ITFC and will continue to implemented under a new agreement with Afreximbank.</narrative>
  </description>
